    pv_site_wa_eu: "Visitors in the European Union are not counted: Cloudflare is set not to collect their data.",
    pv_site_cnt: "When you copy a sticker on the sticker page, the page also sends one small note to a counter: the name of the sticker and the language of the page, nothing else, with no cookie, no account and no identifier. The counter only adds one to that day's total for that sticker; it keeps no list of visitors and our code does not store your address.",
